'''Wim's home''' was the home of the [[human]] [[youngling]] [[Wim]] and his father, [[Wendle]] on the [[planet]] [[At Attin]] during the [[New Republic Era]]. The house had multiple stores and the entry led right into a living area next to the kitchen. It had a garage where Wim stored [[Wim's hoverbike|his hoverbike]].<ref name="Real Adventure" /> 

{{Struct-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Wim's home first appeared in "[[This Could Be a Real Adventure]]"<ref name="Real Adventure" /> the first episode of the live-action [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', which aired on [[December 2]], [[2024]].<ref name="Early">{{SW|url=news/skeleton-crew-premiere-date|text=''Star Wars: Skeleton Crew'' Will Debut Early|date=2024-11-26}}</ref>

